{"ayah/94-1.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Bukankah Kami telah melapangkan bagimu: dadamu (wahai Muhammad serta mengisinya dengan iman dan hidayah petunjuk)?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-1.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Bukankah Kami telah melapangkan bagimu: dadamu (wahai Muhammad serta mengisinya dengan iman dan hidayah petunjuk)?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/94.html\">Surah Ash-Sharh</a> › Ayat 1</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ash-Sharh 94:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Bukankah Kami telah melapangkan bagimu: dadamu (wahai Muhammad serta mengisinya dengan iman dan hidayah petunjuk)?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأتبع الناس لرسوله - صلى الله عليه وسلم - أشرحهم صدرا، وأوضعهم وزرا، وأرفعهم ذكرا<cite>«الكلام على مسألة السماع» 1/277</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s94a1\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/ms/ayah/94-4.html\">Ayat seterusnya (94:4)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/94-4.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:4 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan Kami telah meninggikan bagimu: sebutan namamu (dengan mengurniakan pangkat Nabi dan berbagai kemuliaan)?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:4 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan Kami telah meninggikan bagimu: sebutan namamu (dengan mengurniakan pangkat Nabi dan berbagai kemuliaan)?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/94.html\">Surah Ash-Sharh</a> › Ayat 4</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ash-Sharh 94:4</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan Kami telah meninggikan bagimu: sebutan namamu (dengan mengurniakan pangkat Nabi dan berbagai kemuliaan)?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا كالتشهد والخطب والأذان أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا رسول الله فلا يصح الإسلام إلا بذكره والشهادة له بالرسالة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/104</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s94a4\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/94-1.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (94:1)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/94-7.html\">Ayat seterusnya (94:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/94-7.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:7 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kemudian apabila engkau telah selesai (daripada sesuatu amal soleh), maka bersungguh-sungguhlah engkau berusaha (mengerjakan amal soleh yang lain),\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:7 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kemudian apabila engkau telah selesai (daripada sesuatu amal soleh), maka bersungguh-sungguhlah engkau berusaha (mengerjakan amal soleh yang lain),\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/94.html\">Surah Ash-Sharh</a> › Ayat 7</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ash-Sharh 94:7</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانصَبْ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kemudian apabila engkau telah selesai (daripada sesuatu amal soleh), maka bersungguh-sungguhlah engkau berusaha (mengerjakan amal soleh yang lain),</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">مع أن تفسير قوله: {فإذا فرغت فانصب} أي فرغت من الصلاة قول ضعيف فإن قوله: إذا فرغت مطلق ولأن الفارغ إن أريد به الفارغ من العبادة فالدعاء أيضا عبادة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/496</cite></blockquote><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أشهر قولي المفسرين</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قيل: إذا فرغت من أشغال الدنيا فانصب في العبادة وإلى ربك فارغب. وهذا أشهر القولين.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/495</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعض المفسرين</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «أي فرغت من الصلاة»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/496</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «{فإذا فرغت} من الصلاة {فانصب} في الدعاء {وإلى ربك فارغب} .»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/495</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s94a7\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/94-4.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (94:4)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/94-8.html\">Ayat seterusnya (94:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/94-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan kepada Tuhanmu sahaja hendaklah engkau memohon (apa yang engkau gemar dan ingini).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ash-Sharh 94:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan kepada Tuhanmu sahaja hendaklah engkau memohon (apa yang engkau gemar dan ingini).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/94.html\">Surah Ash-Sharh</a> › Ayat 8</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ash-Sharh 94:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan kepada Tuhanmu sahaja hendaklah engkau memohon (apa yang engkau gemar dan ingini).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل التحسب والرغبة إلى الله وحده.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/276</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالرغبة والتوكل والإنابة والحسب لله وحده<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 1/38</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s94a8\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"